izer for children and adults","continuous-duty nebulizer","GMD nebulizer","home respiratory therapy Colombia","CDK-195 datasheet"],"ficha_fabricante":{"fabricante":"GMD (marca Konfort Plus)","idioma":"es","url_origen":"https://www.gmd.com.co/sfsites/c/cms/delivery/media/MCN4APZMGMFBBSFDDR2DLRKWXUQ4?version=3.1&channelId=0apVT00000000Xu&oid=00D3t000001N5bX","descargada":"2026-10-02"}}$j$::jsonb
