er","paediatric nebulizer compressor","GMD nebulizer","paediatric respiratory therapy Colombia","CDK-222 datasheet"],"ficha_fabricante":{"fabricante":"GMD (marca Carditek)","idioma":"es","url_origen":"https://www.gmd.com.co/sfsites/c/cms/delivery/media/MCSXGOT5KK4ZEH7GATOPSFVZREMM?version=1.1&channelId=0apVT00000000Xu&oid=00D3t000001N5bX","descargada":"2026-10-02"}}$j$::jsonb
