  descripcion_larga_en = $d$Breathing is a reality with the Luxfer oxygen cylinder. It is manufactured from Luxfer's exclusive L6X aluminum alloy, making it 30% lighter than steel cylinders. This feature enhances portability and reduces handling strain for healthcare providers.

The Metal Impact ME-2015 oxygen cylinder is all-metal and made of an aluminium alloy. It has a 680 l capacity, 11.2 cm outside diameter, 64 cm length, 3.4 kg empty weight and 4.6 l internal volume.$d$,
